# What never goes into the image build (Docker rules: every line is relative to the top of the project; "**/" means
# at any depth; a folder that matches takes everything inside it; names compare with case, hence the [xX] classes).
# Keep in step with .railwayignore. No "!" lines: scripts/deploy-ignore.ts proves with this file that nothing
# private is sent (npm run deploy:check).

# The case, the records, backups and anything set aside: never.
[dD][aA][tT][aA]
[dD][aA][tT][aA].*
[dD][aA][tT][aA]-*
[fF][iI][lL][eE][sS]
[bB][aA][cC][kK][uU][pP][sS]
[sS][eE][tT]-[aA][sS][iI][dD][eE]
*.[bB][aA][kK]*
*.[sS][eE][tT]-[aA][sS][iI][dD][eE]*
**/*.[pP][dD][fF]
**/*.[dD][bB]
**/*.[dD][bB]-*
**/*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]*
**/[kK][eE][yY][rR][iI][nN][gG]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
**/[kK][eE][yY][rR][iI][nN][gG]-[bB][aA][cC][kK][uU][pP][sS]
**/*.[zZ][iI][pP]

# Local tools, builds and scratch.
.git
.claude
.tanstack
.tmp
**/.tmp
.tscache
.vite
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
coverage
tests
**/*.log
.env*
**/.env*
*.cmd
AGENTS.md
